1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,293
Ek Hey, kaise ho?

2
00:00:01,777 --> 00:00:03,896
message, aur poori savings gayab.

3
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:05,994
Na koi link, na koi virus.

4
00:00:06,361 --> 00:00:08,306
Phir bhi tumhara phone pehle hi warning de deta hai.

5
00:00:08,727 --> 00:00:09,003
Kaise?

6
00:00:09,496 --> 00:00:13,994
Purana spam filter darwaze pe khade guard jaisa hai, jo sirf number aur link check karta hai.

7
00:00:14,461 --> 00:00:15,818
Naya number, saaf message?

8
00:00:16,176 --> 00:00:16,650
Andar aa jao.

9
00:00:17,114 --> 00:00:18,858
Aur yahi scammers ka loophole hai.

10
00:00:19,336 --> 00:00:22,323
Aaj ka scam ek message mein nahi, poori conversation mein hota hai.

11
00:00:22,797 --> 00:00:23,527
Pehle wrong number.

12
00:00:23,907 --> 00:00:24,408
Phir dosti.

13
00:00:24,772 --> 00:00:26,164
Phir ek zabardast investment.

14
00:00:26,454 --> 00:00:27,746
Aur last mein — paise bhejo.

15
00:00:28,271 --> 00:00:32,415
Yahin aata hai Scam Detection — Google Messages ke andar ek on-device AI.

16
00:00:32,845 --> 00:00:36,965
Simple bhasha mein: guard nahi, ek detective, jo poori kahani padhta hai.

17
00:00:37,449 --> 00:00:43,436
Har naya message aate hi, AI poori chat ka pattern dekhta hai — kaun hai, kya maang raha hai, aur kitni jaldi mein hai.

18
00:00:43,904 --> 00:00:47,466
Pattern scam jaisa laga, toh screen pe seedha warning: Likely scam.

19
00:00:47,922 --> 00:00:49,549
Ek tap mein report, aur block.

20
00:00:50,007 --> 00:00:51,320
Lekin asli twist yahan hai.

21
00:00:51,747 --> 00:00:53,906
Ye sab tumhare phone ke andar hi hota hai.

22
00:00:54,334 --> 00:00:55,989
Tumhari chats kisi server pe nahi jaati.

23
00:00:56,375 --> 00:00:58,620
Aur ye sirf anjaan numbers ki chats check karta hai.

24
00:00:59,059 --> 00:01:04,372
Toh agli baar koi anjaan bole, Hi, kaise ho — tumhara phone poori kahani pehle hi padh chuka hoga.
